Day 3: Playwright Hands-on Task
Task 1: Perform Drag and Drop

📌 Scenario Drag an element and drop it into target area.

▶️ Steps

Navigate to the page. URL: https://playground.bondaracademy.com/pages/extra-components/drag-drop
Identify source element (#dragItem).
Identify target element (#dropZone).
Perform dragTo() action.
Validate target contains dragged element text.
✅ Expected Result

Element should move to drop area.
Target should display updated text (e.g., "Drag Me").
🔹 Task 2 (Easy): Select Value from Old Style Dropdown

📌 Scenario Select a color (e.g., Blue) from the traditional dropdown.

▶️ Steps

Navigate to the select menu page. 🌐 URL: https://demoqa.com/select-menu
Locate the Old Style Select Menu.
Use selectOption() method.
Select value → Blue.
Validate the selected value.
✅ Expected Result

The dropdown should display Blue as the selected option.
🔹 Task 3 (Complex): Select and Manage Multiple Values

📌 Scenario Select multiple values from the multi-select dropdown, then remove one and clear all.

▶️ Steps

Navigate to the page. 🌐 URL: https://demoqa.com/select-menu
Locate Multi Select Drop Down.
Click to open the dropdown.
Select multiple values (e.g., Green, Blue, Black).
Validate all selected values are displayed.
Remove one value using ❌ icon.
Validate that the removed value is no longer present.
Click the clear (cross) icon to remove all selections.
Validate dropdown is empty.
✅ Expected Result

Multiple values should be selected successfully.
Removed value should disappear.
Clear action should remove all selected values.

